    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click, Click, Click, Click, Click, Click, Click........</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an unbelievably boring and simple game I made, but it\u2019s all I can do. Enjoy~</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep clicking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warm Narration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each failed attempt is rewarded with a random speech. Don\u2019t hate me for it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Secret Thing?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game only asks for one action, but you\u2019ll probably overthink it anyway.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endgame</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019ve played enough, you should stop. Seriously.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why You Should Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You love boring things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Our Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally! This is our first game on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We decided to publish a game after learning a few things about game development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re already working on learning more and developing our next game\u2014stay tuned!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click, Click, Click, Click, Click, Click, Click........</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an unbelievably boring and simple game I made, but it\u2019s all I can do. Enjoy~</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep clicking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warm Narration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each failed attempt is rewarded with a random speech. Don\u2019t hate me for it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Secret Thing?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game only asks for one action, but you\u2019ll probably overthink it anyway.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endgame</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019ve played enough, you should stop. Seriously.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why You Should Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You love boring things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Our Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally! This is our first game on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We decided to publish a game after learning a few things about game development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re already working on learning more and developing our next game\u2014stay tuned!</p>",
